WEBVTT

00:00:00.802 --> 00:00:05.436 line:88% position:50% align:center size:80%
Start by adding a data source, with a name and the URL of your JSON.

00:00:09.303 --> 00:00:12.809 line:88% position:50% align:center size:80%
Next, select a component and click Create mapping.

00:00:15.398 --> 00:00:20.250 line:88% position:50% align:center size:80%
Click Link component, and link its properties to fields in your data.

00:00:23.718 --> 00:00:27.381 line:88% position:50% align:center size:80%
Add a binding to link a layer too, like the image.

00:00:30.176 --> 00:00:32.589 line:88% position:50% align:center size:80%
Then save the mapping and give it a name.

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.456 line:88% position:50% align:center size:80%
In the mapping menu, choose how to apply the data.

00:00:40.372 --> 00:00:44.973 line:88% position:50% align:center size:80%
Finally, click Create copies, and every record gets a filled copy.
